---
title: How we receive material
---
Follow these steps every time a delivery comes in.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[Delivery arrives] --> B{Matches the PO?}
  B -->|yes| C[Record the receipt]
  B -->|no| D[Call the supplier]
  D --> C
  C --> E[Shelf and label it]
```

1. Check the challan against the purchase order.
2. Weigh or count what came.
3. Record the receipt in the app and type the rate from the invoice.

> If the count differs from the challan, note it on the receipt. Do not adjust it later.
